Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hanthanhvan4@gmail.com"
}

### Đặt lại mật khẩu: lấy raw token từ email, không phải hash trong MongoDB
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWMyMTM4ZGFkYTYxODE2ZWMxNmUzODIiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTEwMzg5MiwiZXhwIjoxNzkxMTkwMjkyfQ.6AhUZZtxcGzldboyI2zNXvOVKBDbK33W9e3Of1KBjR4",
